{"The conditional inclusion method should end with a question mark (e.g., include_website_name?) to follow ActiveModelSerializers conventions": 0.39563801884651184, "The website_name attribute is derived from the untrusted website field but is not included in the untrusted_attributes list, creating a privacy/security inconsistency": 0.8464260101318359, "The website_name method should memoize the URI object to avoid multiple parsing operations": 0.008354838006198406, "The logic for comparing base domains in website_name can be simplified": 0.022520240396261215, "The trailing slash in the path should be handled for better UX (e.g., example.com/ vs example.com)": 0.0123240165412426, "If website_name is added to untrusted_attributes, the manual include check becomes redundant as the macro handles visibility logic": 0.6137808561325073}